   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "7-step protocol (SYSTEM_PROMPT)\n1. get_logs (PostgreSQL)    2. dt_search_logs (Dynatrace)\n3. CORRELATION SUMMARY: agreement · DT-lag · DT-higher\n4. severity per service → raise_alert for every service;\n    SEV-1 also → call_on_call_engineer (Slack)\n5. send_email_notification ×1    6. save_metrics ×1\n7. final incident report",
   "originalText": "7-step protocol (SYSTEM_PROMPT)\n1. get_logs (PostgreSQL)    2. dt_search_logs (Dynatrace)\n3. CORRELATION SUMMARY: agreement · DT-lag · DT-higher\n4. severity per service → raise_alert for every service;\n    SEV-1 also → call_on_call_engineer (Slack)\n5. send_email_notification ×1    6. save_metrics ×1\n7. final incident report",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "proto",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
