   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. get_logs and dt_search_logs return the same per-service schema, so Gemini compares PG vs DT before acting.\n2. Slack is outbound only: SEV-1 page via Incoming Webhook. No slash command or thread replies. on_call.py is the old mock.\n3. Email is mocked: send_email_notification prints and writes an EMAIL row; there is no SMTP.\n4. RAG is a separate --rag Q&A mode. ★ Exposing it as search_runbooks would let alerts cite the runbook.\n5. OPENAI_API_KEY / openai are installed but unused: embeddings are local MiniLM (384-d), not OpenAI (1536-d).\n6. The agent_runs audit is written straight from agent.py, not through OBS-MCP.",
   "originalText": "1. get_logs and dt_search_logs return the same per-service schema, so Gemini compares PG vs DT before acting.\n2. Slack is outbound only: SEV-1 page via Incoming Webhook. No slash command or thread replies. on_call.py is the old mock.\n3. Email is mocked: send_email_notification prints and writes an EMAIL row; there is no SMTP.\n4. RAG is a separate --rag Q&A mode. ★ Exposing it as search_runbooks would let alerts cite the runbook.\n5. OPENAI_API_KEY / openai are installed but unused: embeddings are local MiniLM (384-d), not OpenAI (1536-d).\n6. The agent_runs audit is written straight from agent.py, not through OBS-MCP.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  }
